---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/diagnostic-tool.css";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Free Website & Ads Diagnostic | Intent & Proof"
	description="Run a free acquisition diagnostic using PageSpeed data, commercial checks and optional Google Ads metrics to identify the most important leak in your lead-generation system."
	canonicalPath="/diagnostic/"
	showRelatedContent={false}
>
	<div class="diagnostic-page" data-diagnostic-tool>
		<section class="diagnostic-hero">
			<div class="diagnostic-shell diagnostic-hero__grid">
				<div>
					<p class="diagnostic-eyebrow">Free Acquisition Diagnostic</p>
					<h1>Find where your website is losing demand.</h1>
					<p class="diagnostic-hero__intro">
						Combine a live mobile PageSpeed scan, ten commercial checks and an optional Google Ads snapshot. The result identifies the strongest part of your acquisition system, the priority leak and the first action worth investigating.
					</p>
					<p class="diagnostic-hero__note">No account connection is required for this first release.</p>
				</div>

				<aside class="diagnostic-preview" aria-label="Example diagnostic result">
					<div class="diagnostic-preview__top">
						<p class="diagnostic-preview__label">Example system score</p>
						<span>Mobile scan</span>
					</div>
					<p class="diagnostic-preview__score">68<span>/100</span></p>
					<p class="diagnostic-preview__status">Promising, but leaking</p>
					<div class="diagnostic-preview__rows">
						<div class="diagnostic-preview__row">
							<span>Technical foundation</span><strong>82</strong>
							<div class="diagnostic-preview__bar"><span style="width:82%"></span></div>
						</div>
						<div class="diagnostic-preview__row">
							<span>Commercial readiness</span><strong>61</strong>
							<div class="diagnostic-preview__bar"><span style="width:61%"></span></div>
						</div>
						<div class="diagnostic-preview__row">
							<span>Ads efficiency</span><strong>54</strong>
							<div class="diagnostic-preview__bar"><span style="width:54%"></span></div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</div>
		</section>

		<main class="diagnostic-main">
			<form class="diagnostic-shell diagnostic-tool" novalidate>
				<section class="diagnostic-panel" aria-labelledby="diagnostic-start-title">
					<span class="diagnostic-step">01</span>
					<p class="diagnostic-section__eyebrow">Start with the website</p>
					<h2 id="diagnostic-start-title">Run the technical scan.</h2>
					<p class="diagnostic-panel__intro">
						We use Google PageSpeed Insights to read mobile performance, SEO, accessibility and browser best-practice signals. The scan is combined with your answers rather than treated as an oracle carved into a Lighthouse report.
					</p>

					<div class="diagnostic-form-grid">
						<div class="diagnostic-field">
							<label for="diagnostic-website">Website address</label>
							<input id="diagnostic-website" name="website" type="url" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://example.com" />
						</div>
						<div class="diagnostic-field">
							<label for="diagnostic-business-type">Business type</label>
							<select id="diagnostic-business-type" name="businessType">
								<option value="B2B service business">B2B service business</option>
								<option value="Professional practice">Professional practice</option>
								<option value="Local service business">Local service business</option>
								<option value="Specialist consultancy">Specialist consultancy</option>
								<option value="Other">Other</option>
							</select>
						</div>
						<div class="diagnostic-field">
							<label for="diagnostic-objective">Primary objective</label>
							<select id="diagnostic-objective" name="objective">
								<option value="Generate more enquiries">Generate more enquiries</option>
								<option value="Improve lead quality">Improve lead quality</option>
								<option value="Improve conversion rate">Improve conversion rate</option>
								<option value="Improve paid search efficiency">Improve paid search efficiency</option>
								<option value="Improve measurement">Improve measurement</option>
							</select>
						</div>
					</div>

					<p class="diagnostic-error" data-url-error hidden>Enter a valid public website address.</p>
					<div class="diagnostic-actions">
						<button class="diagnostic-button" type="button" data-run-scan>Run free diagnostic</button>
						<p class="diagnostic-status" data-scan-status>Usually takes 15–40 seconds, depending on Google and the target site.</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="diagnostic-panel" data-assessment-panel hidden aria-labelledby="diagnostic-assessment-title">
					<span class="diagnostic-step">02</span>
					<p class="diagnostic-section__eyebrow">Commercial readiness</p>
					<h2 id="diagnostic-assessment-title">Add the context an API cannot see.</h2>
					<p class="diagnostic-panel__intro">
						Answer from the perspective of a qualified first-time visitor. Ten checks are enough for a useful first model; nobody needs a 74-question “free” consultation wearing a progress bar.
					</p>

					<div class="diagnostic-question-list">
						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="intent" data-name="intentClarity">
							<legend>Can a first-time visitor understand who you help and the result you provide within a few seconds?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentClarity" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentClarity" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentClarity" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentClarity" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="intent" data-name="intentPages">
							<legend>Do priority services or offers have dedicated pages aligned with a specific buyer need?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentPages" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentPages" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentPages" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="intentPages" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="proof" data-name="proofEvidence">
							<legend>Does the site show concrete cases, outcomes, reviews, credentials or other credible evidence?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofEvidence" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofEvidence" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofEvidence" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofEvidence" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="proof" data-name="proofPlacement">
							<legend>Is proof placed beside the claims, offers and calls to action it is meant to support?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofPlacement" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofPlacement" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofPlacement" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="proofPlacement" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="conversion" data-name="conversionAction">
							<legend>Is there one obvious primary action on the pages that matter commercially?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionAction" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionAction" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionAction" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionAction" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="conversion" data-name="conversionFriction">
							<legend>Can a qualified visitor contact you without unnecessary fields, steps or uncertainty?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionFriction" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionFriction" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionFriction" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="conversionFriction" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="search" data-name="searchRelevance">
							<legend>Do organic and paid landing pages match the query, location or service that brought the visitor?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchRelevance" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchRelevance" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchRelevance" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchRelevance" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="search" data-name="searchStructure">
							<legend>Are titles, headings and page structure built around real commercial demand rather than generic company language?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchStructure" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchStructure" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchStructure" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="searchStructure" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="measurement" data-name="measurementEvents">
							<legend>Are forms, calls, bookings or messaging clicks tracked as meaningful conversions?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementEvents" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementEvents" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementEvents" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementEvents" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>

						<fieldset class="diagnostic-question" data-commercial-question data-category="measurement" data-name="measurementSource">
							<legend>Can you connect enquiries and qualified leads back to their source or campaign?</legend>
							<div class="diagnostic-options">
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementSource" value="yes" /><span>Yes</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementSource" value="partly" /><span>Partly</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementSource" value="no" /><span>No</span></label>
								<label class="diagnostic-option"><input type="radio" name="measurementSource" value="unsure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
							</div>
						</fieldset>
					</div>

					<div class="ads-toggle diagnostic-field">
						<label for="diagnostic-ads">Are you currently using Google Ads?</label>
						<select id="diagnostic-ads" name="usesAds">
							<option value="no">No</option>
							<option value="yes">Yes — include an Ads diagnostic</option>
						</select>
					</div>

					<div class="ads-fields" data-ads-fields hidden>
						<div>
							<p class="diagnostic-section__eyebrow">Optional Google Ads snapshot</p>
							<p class="diagnostic-panel__intro">
								Use one consistent recent period. The tool derives CTR, click-to-lead conversion, cost per lead and qualified-lead rate. These are diagnostic signals, not universal industry commandments.
							</p>
							<div class="ads-metrics">
								<div class="diagnostic-field"><label for="ads-impressions">Impressions</label><input id="ads-impressions" name="adsImpressions" type="number" min="0" inputmode="numeric" /></div>
								<div class="diagnostic-field"><label for="ads-clicks">Clicks</label><input id="ads-clicks" name="adsClicks" type="number" min="0" inputmode="numeric" /></div>
								<div class="diagnostic-field"><label for="ads-cost">Spend</label><input id="ads-cost" name="adsCost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" /></div>
								<div class="diagnostic-field"><label for="ads-conversions">Leads</label><input id="ads-conversions" name="adsConversions" type="number" min="0" inputmode="numeric" /></div>
								<div class="diagnostic-field"><label for="ads-qualified">Qualified leads</label><input id="ads-qualified" name="adsQualified" type="number" min="0" inputmode="numeric" /></div>
								<div class="diagnostic-field"><label for="ads-target-cpl">Target cost per lead</label><input id="ads-target-cpl" name="adsTargetCpl" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" /></div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="diagnostic-form-grid">
							<div class="diagnostic-field">
								<label for="ads-tracking">Reliable conversion tracking?</label>
								<select id="ads-tracking" name="adsTracking"><option value="unsure">Not sure</option><option value="yes">Yes</option><option value="partly">Partly</option><option value="no">No</option></select>
							</div>
							<div class="diagnostic-field">
								<label for="ads-terms">Search terms reviewed regularly?</label>
								<select id="ads-terms" name="adsTerms"><option value="unsure">Not sure</option><option value="yes">Yes</option><option value="partly">Partly</option><option value="no">No</option></select>
							</div>
							<div class="diagnostic-field">
								<label for="ads-negatives">Negative keywords maintained?</label>
								<select id="ads-negatives" name="adsNegatives"><option value="unsure">Not sure</option><option value="yes">Yes</option><option value="partly">Partly</option><option value="no">No</option></select>
							</div>
							<div class="diagnostic-field">
								<label for="ads-landing">Dedicated relevant landing pages?</label>
								<select id="ads-landing" name="adsLanding"><option value="unsure">Not sure</option><option value="yes">Yes</option><option value="partly">Partly</option><option value="no">No</option></select>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<p class="diagnostic-error" data-question-error hidden>Complete all ten commercial checks before generating the score.</p>
					<div class="diagnostic-actions">
						<button class="diagnostic-button" type="button" data-generate-score disabled>Generate my score</button>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="diagnostic-results" data-results hidden aria-live="polite" aria-labelledby="diagnostic-result-title">
					<div class="results-head">
						<div class="results-score"><b data-total-score>--</b><span>/100</span></div>
						<div>
							<p class="diagnostic-section__eyebrow">Intent & Proof score</p>
							<h2 id="diagnostic-result-title" data-result-band>Your diagnostic result</h2>
							<p class="results-summary" data-result-summary></p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="results-grid">
						<article class="result-card">
							<p class="result-card__label">Technical foundation</p>
							<p class="result-card__value" data-technical-score>--</p>
							<p class="result-card__meta">PageSpeed mobile, SEO, accessibility and best practices.</p>
						</article>
						<article class="result-card">
							<p class="result-card__label">Commercial readiness</p>
							<p class="result-card__value" data-commercial-score>--</p>
							<p class="result-card__meta">Intent, proof, conversion, search relevance and measurement.</p>
						</article>
						<article class="result-card">
							<p class="result-card__label">Google Ads efficiency</p>
							<p class="result-card__value" data-ads-score>--</p>
							<p class="result-card__meta">Optional efficiency, lead-quality and account-control signals.</p>
						</article>
					</div>

					<div class="results-metrics" data-result-metrics></div>

					<div class="results-diagnosis">
						<div class="results-diagnosis__box">
							<h3>Signals worth investigating</h3>
							<ul data-result-signals></ul>
						</div>
						<div class="results-diagnosis__box results-diagnosis__box--action">
							<h3>Priority leak: <span data-priority-label></span></h3>
							<p data-priority-action></p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="results-contact">
						<h3>Turn the score into a professional diagnosis.</h3>
						<p>Send the URL, scores and priority leak to Intent & Proof for a human review. The button opens a pre-filled email; nothing is stored automatically in this first release.</p>
						<div class="results-contact__grid">
							<input name="contactName" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" aria-label="Your name" />
							<input name="contactEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Work email" aria-label="Work email" />
							<button class="diagnostic-button" type="button" data-send-result>Send result for review</button>
						</div>
						<div class="diagnostic-actions">
							<button class="diagnostic-button diagnostic-button--secondary" type="button" data-copy-result>Copy result</button>
						</div>
						<p class="results-disclaimer">This automated score is a first-pass diagnostic, not a guarantee of commercial performance. Recommendations identify areas to investigate, not causes proven without account and customer data.</p>
					</div>
				</section>
			</form>
		</main>
	</div>

	<script src="../../scripts/diagnostic-tool.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
